And since it's a Christmas live stream, the stage is also Christmas-themed! Wow, amazing! Usually Dancho has a palace setup in front, but that townscape has powered up into a Christmas version! It's amazing, even the chimneys are decked out!

38
00:07:41,808 --> 00:07:48,508
